{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2fe80dde41dba7943665d9ea92afb148408aed48d7168fd49b71a1c131d1a516",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_22_t01:1_2_030_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afd88176b8fe93ae8576d5c5470214319fbf0290bad1684720834ccbf9f7f41a",
      "text": "晚上好，●●●●プロデューサー。\n今天真的非常感谢您！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_22_t01:1_2_030_22_t01:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:514e41a5db2c74151c1b41a84665a7e32da61fcc34c7430e62da8deceefd65f5",
      "text": "刚才，我和家人一起品尝了\n制作人特意拜托庄一郎先生做的蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_22_t01:1_2_030_22_t01:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:586229cf4ee3188b4a04c09d09a03024c3d90622e4e0ef84719b0e2da0c5aa83",
      "text": "和在Cafe Parade吃到的蛋糕风格完全不一样，\n真的吓了一跳！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_22_t01:1_2_030_22_t01:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a695057a0ee6fb44ed15edda70e592000e84f521d9b7e83831793f9ed3ae2db",
      "text": "两个都超级棒，\n水果和糖艺亮闪闪地散发着光彩……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_22_t01:1_2_030_22_t01:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:120667a814be26ae2a416ad981643c3ba86a22dc13a7af19b6d232bce731ffe1",
      "text": "居然能品尝到2种庄一郎先生亲手制作的生日蛋糕，\n太幸福啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_22_t01:1_2_030_22_t01:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe9508908e454c61e85c36381c716112ef86405cac7d5941dfafd8471d79cba4",
      "text": "能够一起吃到如此特别的蛋糕，\n家人们也都高兴极了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_22_t01:1_2_030_22_t01:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e299e0163eb60fbe87a909c0220d538304bcf3fed98514606d8c8ccbb02a37d9",
      "text": "能让大家满意\n真是太好了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_22_t01:1_2_030_22_t01:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32f002e71b9f074a574ad11479a0b545a566d309f95277ada2da87511d56babb",
      "text": "我也很高兴",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_22_t01:1_2_030_22_t01:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4df92c969188009194b50a8d526a87557b1ff22f1e60b650c5c78f74646eae1",
      "text": "多亏了制作人，\n让我度过了最棒的一天！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_22_t01:1_2_030_22_t01:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e28425fca33530c8c34912d01dfe931279bca99af1166c405297c2034ccadda",
      "text": "非常感谢您！\n我真的特别特别开心。而且……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_22_t01:1_2_030_22_t01:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2f430211ec96ba626a3a213aeda0801444f293cf9844b31cfe9ef0919ad113d",
      "text": "生日能吃到这样的蛋糕，\n感觉是一个绝妙的好兆头呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_22_t01:1_2_030_22_t01:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7d5586e9c57945bbfc7c2d9141f4be4242124dbb607714d34f9808414cfc081",
      "text": "接下来的这一年到底能邂逅什么样的蛋糕呢，\n想想就让人兴奋不已！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_22_t01:1_2_030_22_t01:cmd-000036:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ee4d3688ee9bf5dc674e180ed0a2ca9c8984de94965d8ca21e756f67fc572ac",
      "text": "对了。制作人真正推荐的蛋糕，\n下次也请一定要告诉我哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_22_t01:1_2_030_22_t01:cmd-000038:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c55d4b878df63d50ff372587f8319ae3821c1cf3fe8c6bce31cf184b4a7c34",
      "text": "没问题！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_22_t01:1_2_030_22_t01:cmd-000041:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:581d3a92e75715f3ec436f9b892dff24edbf7ad821547ec467bce68e1eef6bef",
      "text": "能和您一起品尝推荐的蛋糕，\n我很期待哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_22_t01:1_2_030_22_t01:cmd-000043:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42dcc9fe64402111b7b860c0f43e18926898572897b5ee02c7bfcd646a4352e2",
      "text": "明天见面的时候，请再让我好好跟您聊聊蛋糕的话题吧。\n那么，晚安啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
